      "message": "fix(app): warned moves name a lathe HolderHit's move\n\nmain stopped compiling after two merges that each passed alone: PR #454\n(#349) added warned_moves::moves_named, which matches every verify::Warning,\nand PR #395 (#369) added Warning::HolderHit. HolderHit names one move\n(`at`), like FixtureHit, so it joins the single-move arm.\n\nFixes #460\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
